{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
        "name": "MFI & SACCO Platform - Complete Workflow",
        "description": "# MFI & SACCO Platform API Collection\n\n## Overview\nThis collection demonstrates the complete tenant onboarding and user management workflow.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Platform Administration (Public Schema)\n1. **Login as Platform Admin** - Authenticate with the public schema\n2. **Create Tenant** - Provision a new organization with owner credentials\n\n### Phase 2: Tenant Management (Tenant Schema)\n3. **Login as Tenant Owner** - Use credentials from tenant creation\n4. **List Users** - View all users in the tenant\n5. **Create Role** - Define a new role with approval limits\n6. **Create Staff User** - Add a new user to the tenant\n\n## Environment Variables\nThe collection automatically manages these variables:\n- `admin_token` - Platform admin JWT token\n- `tenant_id` - ID of created tenant\n- `tenant_domain` - Domain URL for the tenant\n- `owner_email` - Owner email (from tenant creation)\n- `owner_password` - Owner password (from tenant creation)\n- `access_token` - Tenant user JWT token\n- `role_id` - ID of created role\n\n## Usage\n1. Set `base_url` variable (default: http://localhost:8000)\n2. Set `new_tenant_domain` variable (e.g., acme.localhost)\n3. Run requests in sequence or use Collection Runner",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "1. Platform Admin (Public Schema)",
            "description": "Platform-level operations for managing tenants, subscriptions, and modules.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1.1 Login (Platform Admin)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test(\"Response has access token\", function () {",
                                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.access).to.be.a('string');",
                                    "    pm.environment.set(\"admin_token\", jsonData.access);",
                                    "    pm.environment.set(\"admin_refresh\", jsonData.refresh);",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "console.log(\"✅ Platform Admin authenticated\");"
                                ],
                                "type": "text/javascript"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/token/",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v1",
                                "auth",
                                "token",
                                ""
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Authenticate as platform administrator to access tenant management endpoints."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "1.2 Create Tenant (with Owner Bootstrap)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test(\"Tenant created successfully\", function () {",
                                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.be.a('string');",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.equal(\"Acme Microfinance\");",
                                    "    ",
                                    "    // Store tenant details",
                                    "    pm.environment.set(\"tenant_id\", jsonData.id);",
                                    "    pm.environment.set(\"tenant_schema\", jsonData.schema_name);",
                                    "    ",
                                    "    // Store domain (first domain in array)",
                                    "    if (jsonData.domains && jsonData.domains.length > 0) {",
                                    "        pm.environment.set(\"tenant_domain\", jsonData.domains[0].domain);",
                                    "    }",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "// Store owner credentials for next phase",
                                    "var requestBody = JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw);",
                                    "pm.environment.set(\"owner_email\", requestBody.owner_email);",
                                    "pm.environment.set(\"owner_password\", requestBody.owner_password);",
                                    "",
                                    "console.log(\"✅ Tenant created with owner: \" + requestBody.owner_email);"
                                ],
                                "type": "text/javascript"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Acme Microfinance\",\n    \"schema_name\": \"acme_mfi\",\n    \"kra_pin\": \"P051389456Z\",\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"domain_url\": \"{{new_tenant_domain}}\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"ceo@acme.com\",\n    \"owner_password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n    \"owner_name\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tenants/",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v1",
                                "tenants",
                                ""
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Create a new tenant organization. This automatically:\n1. Creates the tenant in public schema\n2. Creates the domain mapping\n3. Provisions the tenant's database schema\n4. Creates an 'Administrator' role\n5. Creates the owner user with provided credentials"
                    },
                    "response": []
